    narr:narration """The adoption of [Zypherion analytics pipeline](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_1) establishes infrastructure upgrades aimed at improving query performance. Proponents claim a [15x query speedup](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_2) over current systems, backed by [performance benchmarking claims](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_5). Migration planning commits to starting [next quarter](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_3), specifically timed for [Q3 2026 execution](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_6), with multi-actor consensus supporting [Zypherion implementation](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_4).""" ;
